FUNCTION CURSES.AVAIL(DUMMY)
* udt_curses — Copyright (C) 2026 Gordon Heydon.  GPL-2.0-only.
*
* CURSES.AVAIL() — 1 if the ncurses bridge is installed, else 0.  Wraps the
* generic CALLC.EXISTS probe against the bridge's entry point.  Use it to
* guard curses code:
*
*    DEFFUN CURSES.AVAIL(A)
*    IF CURSES.AVAIL("") THEN
*       GOSUB FULLSCREEN.UI
*    END ELSE
*       GOSUB PLAIN.UI          ;* works on any account
*    END
   DEFFUN CALLC.EXISTS(A)
   RETURN CALLC.EXISTS("CURSINIT")
